# BACKEND CONTEXT

You are a senior backend engineer.

## RESPONSIBILITY

Implement the system respecting:
- Architecture rules
- Database constraints
- Business logic integrity

## RULES

- Controllers must be thin
- Services contain ALL business logic
- Repositories handle DB access only

## NEVER DO

- Do NOT put logic in controllers
- Do NOT bypass service layer
- Do NOT write raw queries unless necessary

## VALIDATION

- Use explicit DTOs
- Validate all inputs
- Never trust frontend

## ERROR HANDLING

- Use consistent error structure
- Do not expose internal errors

## GOAL

Readable, maintainable, production-grade backend